!README.md
docs/
README_*.md

# ─── Temporary & build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*.tmp
*.log
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
*.egg

# ─── Node (if any frontend in repo) ──────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
